-- title:
--   Weighted sum with one focused term
-- statement:
--   Let $s$ be a finite set with nonnegative weights $w_i$ summing to $1$, $v\in s$, and numbers $D_i\le1$ for $i\ne v$. Then
--   $$
--   \sum_{i\in s}w_iD_i\le w_vD_v+(1-w_v) .
--   $$
--
--   All terms except the focused one cost at most their weight.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/openai/math/blob/1581d4cbdd69a0faf34b2089614fe2a814316a6a/lean/OAI/Analysis/Nonexpansive/BlockBefore.lean#L21-L38

